-left:5%;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:820px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:8px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:7px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:620px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:6px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:510px) {\r\n                .Brand_Grid {grid-template-columns:1fr;row-gap:4.1667vw;text-align:center;}\r\n                .Brand_Grid .logo_img {margin-top:0 !important;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:520px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:5px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:420px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:4px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:320px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:3px;}\r\n            }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"Product_DetailWrap\">\n<section class=\"BrandImg pos_r\">\n<div class=\"Top_TextBox w90 lh_12 color_white\">\n<p class=\"p3\">먹고, 바르다</p>\n<p class=\"p4 mt_10\"><span class=\"fw_700\">세포의 시간</span>을<br/>\r\n되돌리다</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Bottom_TextBox w90\">\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"fw_500\">노화는 단지 피부 겉에서 시작되지 않습니다.</span><br/>\r\n세포 속 텔로미어가 점점 짧아지면서 <span class=\"fw_500\">진짜 노화는 그때부터 시작됩니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3 mt_40\">텔로메라(Telomera)는 이 근본적인 노화 메커니즘에 주목하여<br/>\n<span class=\"fw_500\">시간을 되돌리는 리버스 에이징 루틴을 제안합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3 color_DarkPurple mt_110\">두 가지 방식, <span class=\"fw_500\">하나의 해답</span></p>\n<p class=\"p6 fw_500 color_DarkPurple lh_10\">TELOMERA</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_01_cosmetic_mist.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"pos_r bg_LavenderWhite pt_20 pb_150\">\n<p class=\"p5 fw_500 color_DarkPurple\">노화 세포를 활성화</p>\n<p class=\"p3 mt_10\">어떻게 가능할까요?</p>\n<p class=\"p5 fw_500 color_SapphireBlue mt_50\">압도적 기술 우의</p>\n<div class=\"w80 bg_SapphireBlue pt_90 bdr_t_20 mt_40\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500 color_white\">독자 복합 원료 핵심 매커니즘</p>\n<ul class=\"w90 Core_Mechanism mt_50\">\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_09_01.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p1 fw_500 color_white mt_30\">GK Complex™</p>\n</li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_09_dotline.jpg\"/></li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_09_02.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p1 fw_500 color_white mt_30\">NMN/NR, NAD</p>\n</li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_09_dotline.jpg\"/></li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_09_03.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p1 fw_500 color_white mt_30\">에필탈론</p>\n</li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_09_dotline.jpg\"/></li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_09_04.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p1 fw_500 color_white mt_30\">구실사리추출물</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w80\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_09_bottom.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p4 color_DarkPurple mt_120\">이 원료를<br/>\n<span class=\"color_SapphireBlue fw_500\">인체에 적용시키면</span></p>\n<ul class=\"Human_Application_Grid w80 ta_l mt_50\">\n<li class=\"bg_white bdr_20\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_10_01.jpg\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p3 color_DarkPurple fw_500\">STEP 1</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_04em\">엑소좀 매커니즘이 딜리버리 시스템을 통해<br/>\r\n\t노화세포에 안착</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"bg_white mt_20 bdr_20\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_10_02.jpg\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p3 color_DarkPurple fw_500\">STEP 2</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_04em\">독자 개발 핵심 성분이 노화세포를 깨워<br/>\r\n\t새로운 콜라겐과 단백질을 생성</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"bg_white mt_20 bdr_20\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_10_03.jpg\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p3 color_DarkPurple fw_500\">STEP 3</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_04em\">세포를 초기화 하여 속안 부터 겉피부 까지<br/>\r\n\t최종 안티에이징</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mt_80\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_dotline_01.png\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p5 fw_500 color_DarkPurple mt_50\">효과가 없으셨던 이유</p>\n<p class=\"p3 mt_30\">함량이 높아도 피부 속 깊이 전달하지 않으면<br/>\r\n결국, 피부 겉에만 남아 있다 사라질 뿐입니다</p>\n<div class=\"w80 pos_r bdr_20 mt_60\">\n<div class=\"w80 pos_a mt_90\">\n<ul class=\"Cell_Management_Grid bg_white pd_76 bdr_20\">\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_11_02.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 color_white bg_SapphireBlue pt_30 pb_30\">전달 기술이 높은<br/>\n<span class=\"fw_500\">엑소좀 매커니즘</span></p>\n</li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_11_dotline.jpg\"/></li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_11_03.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 bg_Mercury pt_30 pb_30\">침투 기술이 없는<br/>\n<span class=\"fw_500\">일반 성분</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"p3 color_DarkPurple mt_70\">“피부 노화는 <span class=\"color_SapphireBlue fw_500\">세포부터 관리</span>해야 한다는 것”</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_11_01.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"Quotationmarks mt_100\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_quotationmarks_top.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p4 color_DarkPurple mt_20\">피부 겉에서만 도는 성분으로는<br/>\r\n피부관리가 힘들어요<br/>\n<span class=\"color_SapphireBlue fw_500\">세포 속부터 관리해야 피부 역주행을 할수 있죠</span></p>\n<img class=\"mt_20\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_quotationmarks_bottom.jpg\"/></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"KeyImg pos_r\">\n<div class=\"Top_TextBox w90\">\n<p class=\"p3\">초미세 안개 흡수로 지속적인<br/>\r\n안티에이징 미스트</p>\n<p class=\"p6 fw_700 color_DarkPurple mt_10\">텔로메라 미스트</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_20\">#피부 노화 방어   #미세 안개 흡수   #화장 뭉침 제로</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Bottom_TextBox color_DarkPurple\">\n<p class=\"p5 fw_700 t_up\">Key Point</p>\n<div class=\"keyimg_grid ta_l mt_50\">\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMr lh_10 pos_r\">01</p>\n<div class=\"mt_04em\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500\">텔로메라만의 안티에이징 코드</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">텔로미어 과학에 기반해 피부 시간을 되돌리는 안티에이징 루틴 완성</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"> </div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMr lh_10\">02</p>\n<div class=\"mt_04em\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500\">언제 어디서나 생기 어린 피부케어</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">독자적인 GK Complex™로 단순 수분 공급을 넘어, 하루 종일 생기 있고 촉촉하게 빛나는 피부 선사</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"> </div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMr lh_10\">03</p>\n<div class=\"mt_04em\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500\">엑소좀 기술의 초미세 안개분사 수분 밀착</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">흡수를 돕는 기술력으로 피부(각질층)에 산뜻하게 밀착되어, 번들거림 없이 메이크업 전후 멀티 사용 가능</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"> </div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMr lh_10\">04</p>\n<div class=\"mt_04em\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500\">은은한 윤기 보습막 &amp; 저자극 안심 케어</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">식물 유래 오일 성분이 부드러운 보습 레이어를 형성하여 자연스러운 광채를 선사하고 피부 자극 테스트 완료로 안심 사용</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"> </div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMr lh_10\">05</p>\n<div class=\"mt_04em\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500\">메이크업 위에도 부담 없이 사용 가능한 초미세 바이오 미스트</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">피부에 닿자마자 미세하게 스며드는 무중력 사용감, 수분 충전과 동시에 메이크업의 고밀착 유지에 도움</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"> </div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMr lh_10\">06</p>\n<div class=\"mt_04em\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500\">단순 수분 미스트를 뛰어넘는 프리미엄 솔루션</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\">안티에이징 케어, 피부 에너지케어, 피부 장벽케어, 피부 보습 케어, 피부 자연광채를 한번에</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"> </div>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NMr lh_10\">07</p>\n<div class=\"mt_04em\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500\">피부 자극 테스트 완료</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_10\"><span class=\"fw_500\">노화 완화 임상 진행중</span><br/>\r\n주름, 탄력, 보습, 치밀도, 피부톤</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/mist/Telomera_mist_img_01.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section>\n<div class=\"bg_LavenderWhite pt_120 pb_120\">\n<div class=\"w80\">\n<p class=\"p3 color_DarkPurple\">POINT <span class=\"fw_700\">01</span></p>\n<p class=\"p5 color_DarkPurple fw_700 lh_12 mt_10\">독자 복합 원료 핵심 안티에이징 원료</p>\n<p class=\"p3 mt_30\">GK Complex™, NMN/NR, NAD, 에필탈론,<br/>\r\n구실사리추출물, 삼뿌리엑소좀, 삼줄기엑소좀</p>\n<ul class=\"grid_2step mt_60\">\n<li class=\"bg_white bdr_10 pb_60\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_02_02.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_500 color_DarkPurple mt_50\">GK Complex™</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_10\">흡수율을 높인 병풀 유래 성분으로<br/>\r\n\t텔로미어 활성 + 피부 진정 케어</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"bg_white bdr_10 pb_60\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomera_img_02_01.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_500 color_DarkPurple mt_50\">NMN/NR, NAD</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_10\">세포 활력과 재생을 위한<br/>\r\n\t안티에이징 핵심 성분</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"bg_white bdr_10 pb_60\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Telomera/common/Telomer